            "description": "<p>Shares of Strive Asset Management (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ASST\">ASST</a>) are jumping in early trading on Monday. According to <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://sherwood.news/markets/strive-the-vivek-ramaswamy-backed-bitcoin-treasury-company-is-surging-again/\">Sherwood News</a>, the stock is seeing increased interest from retail traders.</p>\n<p>On October 16, Strive CEO Matt Cole sat down with host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> to explain the difference between investing in a cryptocurrency or a crypto treasury company, while addressing Wall Street criticisms of this portion of the crypto landscape.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
